<metadata preset-name="Studio Pop Clean" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A polished modern pop clean that sits under a vocal: a tube leveling amp evens out every strum, a small blackface combo adds warmth and sparkle, and an EQ trims mud and adds air before a short plate. Strum or arpeggiate; the dynamics stay even and the top end stays smooth." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
